WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:30.625
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:31.708
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:34.833
shed light on the importance of devotion.

4
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:36.541
Now in this verse too,

5
00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:37.541
an important apparent

6
00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:40.250
contradiction He clarifies.

7
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.541
He speaks of His equality

8
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.833
and impartiality

9
00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:45.291
toward all living beings.

10
00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:46.250
At the same time,

11
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.500
with His devotees

12
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.583
His special relationship He also explains.

13
00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:56.625
Lord Krishna in this verse

14
00:00:56.625 --> 00:00:59.333
first declares

15
00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:01.625
that He is impartial toward all.

16
00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:04.208
Neither does He hold envy toward anyone,

17
00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:05.250
nor to anyone

18
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.416
does He show special preference.

19
00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:10.375
He compares Himself to rain,

20
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:13.250
which falls equally on the ground.

21
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.916
Whether the earth yields sweet fruit or bitter –

22
00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:19.666
that depends on the nature of the soil,

23
00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:21.250
not on the rain.

24
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.333
In the same way, Lord Krishna's impartial care

25
00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:26.583
nourishes all beings,

26
00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:28.125
but their own responses

27
00:01:28.125 --> 00:01:29.541
determine the results

28
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:31.041
of their experiences.

29
00:01:31.041 --> 00:01:33.333
Yet Lord Krishna on a deeper

30
00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:35.333
truth sheds light, that

31
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.916
those who come to Him with devotion,

32
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:39.583
they with Him a unique

33
00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.875
closeness experience.

34
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:43.166
For such devotees

35
00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:45.750
Lord Krishna declares –

36
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.791
'They are in Me

37
00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:50.333
and I am in them.'

38
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:53.000
This personal and mutual bond

39
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.750
is the primary mark of pure devotion.

40
00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.500
Lord Krishna as the impartial Supreme

41
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.416
nourishes all beings.

42
00:02:01.416 --> 00:02:03.791
His relationship with His devotees

43
00:02:03.791 --> 00:02:06.916
is filled with love and care,

44
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:10.541
which goes far beyond mere sustenance.

45
00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:13.916
These two aspects of Lord Krishna's nature –

46
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.250
impartiality and special care.

47
00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.166
The existence of these two aspects

48
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:22.166
may seem contradictory, but

49
00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:25.750
in reality they are in perfect harmony.

50
00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.333
As a judge, Lord Krishna

51
00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:31.416
is impartial, ensuring

52
00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:34.791
that every person receives the
fruit of their own actions.

53
00:02:34.791 --> 00:02:36.833
But as the Lord,

54
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:39.208
as the loving Master,

55
00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:40.500
He personally

56
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.416
connects with those people

57
00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:45.416
who come to Him with love.

58
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:48.625
His 'partiality' toward devotees is not a flaw,

59
00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:49.958
but a natural outcome

60
00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:52.541
of mutual affection.

61
00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:54.458
Just as parents

62
00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:56.791
love all their children,

63
00:02:56.791 --> 00:02:59.083
yet share a deeper bond

64
00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:02.125
with those children who with love and

65
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:05.208
trust obey them.

66
00:03:05.208 --> 00:03:06.041
Lord Krishna

67
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:09.375
extends His love universally,

68
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:10.833
but with His devotees

69
00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:13.791
He deepens this love.

70
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:16.833
This principle of divine reciprocity

71
00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:18.083
elevates devotional

72
00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:20.666
service beyond mere ritual.

73
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:23.333
It makes it the path to an eternal,

74
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:27.458
joyful relationship with the Lord.

75
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.333
Have you ever wondered

76
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.416
how even in life's

77
00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:41.041
inequalities divine justice

78
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:44.541
works?

79
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:46.041
When life

80
00:03:46.041 --> 00:03:49.625
goes against your hopes,

81
00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:54.625
you feel abandoned.

82
00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:56.791
You think

83
00:03:56.791 --> 00:03:59.375
that I do not pay attention

84
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:02.541
to you, but

85
00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:06.208
I assure you,

86
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.958
I hold envy toward no one,

87
00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:14.000
nor do I take anyone's side.

88
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:19.041
Just as on hearing the sweet
notes of a flute-player's flute,

89
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:21.541
in every listener's heart

90
00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:25.000
sugar dissolves,

91
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.166
I too in the same way to all equally

92
00:04:29.166 --> 00:04:32.666
play My melody of grace.

93
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:34.250
My compassionate gaze

94
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.375
falls equally on everyone.

95
00:04:38.375 --> 00:04:42.250
I am always with you.

96
00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:45.875
Waiting, witnessing,

97
00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:47.875
and to guide

98
00:04:47.875 --> 00:04:51.125
ever ready.

99
00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:54.916
My nature too is reciprocal.

100
00:04:54.916 --> 00:04:57.750
If you listen, I will speak.

101
00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.583
If you ask, I will answer.

102
00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:04.916
If you ask to be shown, I will show.

103
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:05.958
If you

104
00:05:05.958 --> 00:05:10.416
even with a small effort move toward Me,

105
00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:12.916
I infinitely

106
00:05:12.916 --> 00:05:15.625
respond in return.

107
00:05:15.625 --> 00:05:18.125
The clouds of doubt

108
00:05:18.125 --> 00:05:21.625
do not let settle over your heart.

109
00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:23.541
With faith

110
00:05:23.541 --> 00:05:26.000
come to Me.

111
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.500
You in your life

112
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.625
My presence will surely experience.

113
00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:35.250
It may be that experience

114
00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.875
will not come as you expect,

115
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:40.708
but

116
00:05:40.708 --> 00:05:43.041
this is My promise –

117
00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:46.250
I will guide you,

118
00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.416
I will help you.

119
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:51.416
Trust Me.

120
00:05:51.416 --> 00:05:53.375
I am with you.

121
00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:57.125
Not only in your rise,

122
00:05:57.125 --> 00:06:01.166
but also in your struggles.

123
00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:04.250
Take one step toward Me

124
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:10.166
and see how I, at every turn of life's journey,

125
00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:12.416
walk with you.

126
00:06:17.083 --> 00:06:20.958
Life's great wonder is this –

127
00:06:20.958 --> 00:06:23.125
within equality

128
00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:26.208
uniqueness.

129
00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:29.833
As the head of a family,

130
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:34.375
take inspiration from My example.

131
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:38.750
I hold equal regard for all.

132
00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.541
I show no favouritism.

133
00:06:41.541 --> 00:06:43.708
I treat every person

134
00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:48.083
according to their needs.

135
00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:50.541
Just as a homemaker

136
00:06:50.541 --> 00:06:54.416
cooks different dishes according to their nature,

137
00:06:54.416 --> 00:06:57.625
in different ways,

138
00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:01.791
in the same way you too attend

139
00:07:01.791 --> 00:07:04.875
to your family members' varying needs.

140
00:07:04.875 --> 00:07:07.583
When in your family

141
00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:11.541
you show favouritism, it is just like

142
00:07:11.541 --> 00:07:13.833
cooking some dishes well

143
00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:17.375
and others impatiently.

144
00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:20.666
As a result, some will turn out tasty,

145
00:07:20.666 --> 00:07:22.750
others tasteless.

146
00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.375
But if you with impartiality

147
00:07:26.375 --> 00:07:30.125
each member's needs understand,

148
00:07:30.125 --> 00:07:36.500
then you establish unity and harmony.

149
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:37.666
In a family,

150
00:07:37.666 --> 00:07:41.000
every person is unique.

151
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.500
Some need encouragement,

152
00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.750
some need direction,

153
00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.958
some need boundaries.

154
00:07:49.958 --> 00:07:51.750
Your responsibility is

155
00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:56.500
to give them what for their growth is helpful.

156
00:07:56.500 --> 00:08:01.041
Lead with equanimity, not favouritism.

157
00:08:01.041 --> 00:08:06.958
For your family members be
a steady and impartial guide.

158
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:08.041
Trust and

159
00:08:08.041 --> 00:08:09.708
mutual respect's

160
00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:13.000
culture nurture.

161
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.041
When you walk this path,

162
00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:18.625
your family becomes strong.

163
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:21.500
Your relationships take deep root

164
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.541
in trust, love, and understanding.

165
00:08:24.541 --> 00:08:28.208
Remember, just as the Saptarishi

166
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:31.708
stars, though separate,

167
00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:34.583
form one constellation,

168
00:08:34.583 --> 00:08:38.333
exactly in the same way your family too

169
00:08:38.333 --> 00:08:42.791
can become a symbol of unity in diversity.

170
00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:52.625
At the workplace, when leading, rise above bias

171
00:08:52.625 --> 00:08:58.250
and practise seeing all with an equal eye.

172
00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.750
Just as I everywhere

173
00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.750
hold equal regard.

174
00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:08.500
I give no one priority over another.

175
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:12.625
I treat every soul according to their actions

176
00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:16.583
and needs.

177
00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:19.958
Think of a project

178
00:09:19.958 --> 00:09:22.583
where one person

179
00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:26.333
is skilled in analytical work,

180
00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:27.625
while another

181
00:09:27.625 --> 00:09:31.375
is gifted in creative solutions,

182
00:09:31.375 --> 00:09:32.916
and a third

183
00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:35.541
is skilled in communication.

184
00:09:35.541 --> 00:09:39.083
If you favour only the first person

185
00:09:39.083 --> 00:09:43.375
and give them all the key opportunities,

186
00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:45.791
then what will happen?

187
00:09:45.791 --> 00:09:49.166
The project will become unbalanced.

188
00:09:49.166 --> 00:09:53.125
The morale of the second and
third person will drop,

189
00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:59.333
and ultimately the quality of work will suffer.

190
00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:01.166
In a professional environment

191
00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:03.000
bias quickly

192
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.125
erodes trust.

193
00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:10.500
It damages enthusiasm and cooperation.

194
00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:14.916
Let us understand this with an example.

195
00:10:14.916 --> 00:10:18.041
In many successful organisations
it has been seen

196
00:10:18.041 --> 00:10:21.791
that when the leader gives every member

197
00:10:21.791 --> 00:10:25.291
an opportunity according to their ability

198
00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:27.166
and each member's

199
00:10:27.166 --> 00:10:30.625
unique talent respects,

200
00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:33.291
then the organisation's innovation

201
00:10:33.291 --> 00:10:37.583
and productivity grow remarkably.

202
00:10:37.583 --> 00:10:40.250
When you even unintentionally

203
00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:43.750
unduly support someone,

204
00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:47.250
it creates division.

205
00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.416
It weakens

206
00:10:48.416 --> 00:10:52.125
the unity of your work culture.

207
00:10:52.125 --> 00:10:53.625
But

208
00:10:53.625 --> 00:10:59.500
when you treat every employee with fairness,

209
00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.375
then you inspire loyalty

210
00:11:01.375 --> 00:11:04.416
and respect.

211
00:11:04.416 --> 00:11:06.625
You according to their strengths

212
00:11:06.625 --> 00:11:08.541
and challenges

213
00:11:08.541 --> 00:11:10.875
provide guidance.

214
00:11:10.875 --> 00:11:14.750
As a leader, your duty is

215
00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:15.958
in each person

216
00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:18.958
the hidden potential to recognise –

217
00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:20.541
that is your responsibility.

218
00:11:20.541 --> 00:11:23.833
To guide them toward growth,

219
00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:26.458
above personal preferences

220
00:11:26.458 --> 00:11:29.708
to keep collective progress paramount,

221
00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:32.875
recognise everyone's abilities.

222
00:11:32.875 --> 00:11:35.500
Awaken everyone.

223
00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.458
Give work according to their
qualities and discernment.

224
00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:41.166
Bring everyone together.
